SwiftTerm 1.20.0 (https://github.com/migueldeicaza/SwiftTerm), MIT license (see LICENSE).

Local changes:
- Apple/Metal/Shaders.metal removed: the optional Metal renderer is not
  used by ZeonVNC and building the shader needs Xcode's separate Metal
  toolchain. SwiftTerm renders with CoreText by default.
- SwiftTermBuildInfo.swift added (normally generated by a build plugin).
- Mac/MacTerminalView.swift paste(_:): line breaks are sent as a single CR
  (CRLF from web pages otherwise becomes two Returns).
